comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-14T04:27:40.097Z",codex-agent,"Plan: preserve fixture classifications, add a 100k-character timing regression, map current unresolved threads to tracker items, add local review find, apply non-thread votes through addReaction, and prove each regression by reverting its changed function. All remote tests use synthetic transport fixtures; live dogfood is read-only."
  "2026-10-14T04:42:26.581Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof: replacing only isInformational with its origin/main function makes the 100k timing test fail by ETIMEDOUT. Replacing only evaluateRound loses unresolved_thread_details; replacing only dispatchReviewCommand breaks review find; replacing only decide restores the non-thread apply rejection. Each regression fails with that single function reverted. All functions restored and package rebuilt. All 76 unique recorded fixture bodies retain their baseline informational and severity classifications."
  "2026-10-14T04:54:32.128Z",codex-agent,"Read-only built-package dogfood: initialized a scratch tracker with pm init, installed the packed build, imported public bot context and ran pm review round --repo unbraind/pm-review --pr 7 (JSON and compact, no --apply). PR state is MERGED. Output excerpt: review unbraind/pm-review#7 head=1da5e10d3ccc6046dfea0cf67dfcffa4e3026a59 complete=false checks=pending coderabbit=missing unresolved=0 unvoted=0 pending=2 unimported=0. Existing author votes were observed without remote mutations; merged state does not substitute for exact-head review evidence or durable decisions in a fresh tracker."
  "2026-10-14T04:54:38.137Z",codex-agent,"Gates passed: env -u PM_PATH -u PM_AUTHOR HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check; the same isolated environment with bun run release:check. Each runs 99/99 tests, 100/100/100/100 coverage over 17 source files, zero fail/skip/cancel/todo, zero duplicated lines, clean production audit and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus native Bun/bunx acceptance. Linked node --test test/review-regressions.test.ts passed 9/9 via pm test --run --progress. Local CodeQL CLI is unavailable; the PR GitHub CodeQL analysis supplies scanner proof. Delivery branch: fix/redos-safe-findings-and-round-mapping; items stay in progress for orchestrator verification."
